      "lines": [
        "如果已知的平面是不同的平面，上述判定定理的正确性",
        "可以从以前的论证中得出. 这个证明用符号写出如下："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知：$a\\subset\\alpha$，$b\\subset\\alpha$，$a\\cap b=B$；$a_1\\subset\\beta$，$b_1\\subset\\beta$；$a_1\\mathbin{//}a$，",
        "$b_1\\mathbin{//}b$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求证：$\\alpha\\mathbin{//}\\beta$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明（反证法）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假设 $\\alpha\\cap\\beta=C$. 有："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(a\\mathbin{//}a_1,a\\subset\\alpha,a_1\\subset\\beta)\\Rightarrow c\\mathbin{//}a$（定理 4）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(b\\mathbin{//}b_1,b\\subset\\alpha,b_1\\subset\\beta)\\Rightarrow c\\mathbin{//}b$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们得到与平行公理相矛盾的情形. 所以，$\\alpha\\mathbin{//}\\beta$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "平面 $\\alpha$ 和 $\\beta$ 重合时也满足定理的条件（图 31）. 因为重合",
        "的平面平行. 在这种情形下，判定定理仍然正确."
      ]
    },
